{"id":"wb-8-137","name":"德源古城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"德源古城遗址","text":"德源古城遗址位于云南省大理白族自治州洱源县邓川镇新州村德源山山顶上，是唐代前期至南诏时期的一处重要城邑遗址。该城原名邆川城（邓川城），是六诏之一邆赕诏的诏城所在，南诏统一洱海地区后成为其北方的军事屏障。德源古城遗址是已知保存最好的南诏时期城邑遗址，1987年列入第三批云南省文物保护单位，2019年列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BE%B7%E6%BA%90%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92646940,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92646940","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ddb8b3b56d3ebfa768678c3f.jpg","title":"德源古城遗址_2024-08-08_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BE%B7%E6%BA%90%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80_2024-08-08_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/%E5%BE%B7%E6%BA%90%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80_2024-08-08_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​德源古城遗址","width":320,"height":240}}